  "summary": "TRC-A-3A is a touchscreen apartment controller for ventilation and room temperature, with home/away/boost modes, three analog outputs and digital inputs. The BAC model speaks BACnet MS/TP (B-ASC). Its object map differs from the TRC-P: measurements are AIs, settings AVs, digital inputs BIs and mode flags BOs (40 objects).",
