    "Object names, ranges and units are from the user guide, chapter 5 (software 5.02 or newer); the guide has no read/write column, so access is inferred from what each object does.",
    "Configuration parameters sit in proprietary objects (type proprietary-128) and are not listed.",
    "The Alarm MSV carries a 7-bit alarm word plus 1 (sensors, DI1, supply and extract air flow).",
    "MS/TP 9600 (default), 19200, 38400, 56000 or 76800 bit/s."
